{# Radius
   Without a radius, the badge uses the default radius of your theme. Set it to
   change the shape of a single badge (for example, full for pill-like tags). #}
<twig:ea:Badge color="info" radius="none">none</twig:ea:Badge>
<twig:ea:Badge color="info" radius="sm">sm</twig:ea:Badge>
<twig:ea:Badge color="info" radius="md">md</twig:ea:Badge>
<twig:ea:Badge color="info" radius="lg">lg</twig:ea:Badge>
<twig:ea:Badge color="info" radius="full">full</twig:ea:Badge>
